# URL routing (user preference)

- **Public routes only:** `/home/` (portfolio) and `/about.html`. Root `/` redirects to `/home/`.
- **Do not** put project slugs in the URL — no `#runway-ai`, `#samsung`, `#chase-travel-redesign`, etc.
- Project `<article>` elements must **not** use `id={section.id}` (fragments would expose slugs). Use classes or `data-*` for styling/JS hooks instead.
- Do not add `history.pushState` / hash updates for scroll position or active project.
- When linking the live site, use `https://ashlonfrank.github.io/home/` or `/about.html` only.
